# R28: MD39a's drive (research/md39a/drive.pad, tick for tick) with the right stick swinging MX vs. ATV's
# follow camera round towards the front. Full stick turns the user yaw 0.05 a tick (cam +0xdc) and the
# camera's yaw is pi minus it; the stick does nothing for the state's first ~20 ticks. The swings put the
# yaw inside the rear fade (1.047..pi/2) while the car pulls away under 29.33 ft/s, past it (yaw < 1.047:
# no look-ahead, lag scale 0.25) at speed and over the jump, then the other way into the fade again as the
# brake stops the car, and on past it while it stands and pulls away again.
sleep 15t
down cross
stick l 1 0
sleep 5t
stick r 1 0
sleep 36t
stick r 0 0
sleep 4t
stick l 0 0
sleep 60t
stick r 1 0
sleep 10t
stick r 0 0
sleep 150t
stick r -1 0
sleep 20t
stick l -1 0
sleep 40t
stick l 0 0
stick r 0 0
sleep 20t
stick l 1 0
sleep 40t
stick l 0 0
stick r -1 0
sleep 20t
stick r 0 0
up cross
down square
sleep 50t
stick r -1 0
sleep 10t
stick r 0 0
sleep 30t
up square
down cross
sleep 60t
stick l -1 0
down circle
stick r 1 0
sleep 30t
up circle
stick l 0 0
stick r 0 0
sleep 90t
release
sleep 45t
